(7643761, 1241340, 86447, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting that this got third place in a high-scoring gallery and there are no comments.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your RIBBON!<br/> <br/>I think it''s because everything is so... ummmm... harsh? With the smoothness of the water...  People like it because of its dichotomy, but don''t know what to say about it.<br/> <br/>Congrats!   You''ve rendered us speechless.  :D</td>', 'It''s interesting that this got third place in a high-scoring gallery and there are no comments. Congratulations on your RIBBON! I think it''s because everything is so... ummmm... harsh? With the smoothness of the water...  People like it because of its dichotomy, but don''t know what to say about it. Congrats!   You''ve rendered us speechless.  :D', '2019-10-15 21:12:11.000000', NULL, 0),
